Z||000000||FieroGTguy||04-10-2001||03:08 AM||||Hello everyone...  I have been a Fiero mailing list member for over 3 years now.  I am just now joining this forum of cool people.  I have spent over $7000 and 2 years on modifying my 86 GT.  And I just found another 86 GT that has the  same modifications AND the engine I want...  So...  This summer I will be selling my prized GT, as well as starting a unique Fiero modification website.  I have come up with some REALLY cool mods that have never been mentioned before, and I already have the domain and hosting for them.  <P>I just wanted to introduce my presence, and give you guys something to look forward to.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> <P>I will probably give you guys a taste of the cool mods that I am talking about if there is a large enough response.  It feels like I am holding them in the closet until Christmas.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
