Z||000004||jch82||04-10-2001||08:58 AM||||What kind of mods we talking here?? engine? exterior? interior?<P>Come on, we all want details!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Yeah, my girlfriend takes collect calls from the road<BR>And it doesn't seem to matter that I'm lacking in the bulge<BR>She laughs at my dumb jokes when no one does<BR>She brings me mexican food from Sombrero's just because<BR>                 <I>-Blink 182</I>||||reg||1
Z||000005||FieroGTguy||04-10-2001||11:42 AM||||Forgot to mention that I am not a mechanic, and they aren't performance type mods.  My personal mod info will be mainly interior, exterior, and stereo.  <P>I am the guy that made the first fiberglass sub box with the JL subwoofer many years ago.  I traded it for a running 84 Indy that I put a lot of money into, and had to sell it for a loss.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  It was a big hit at the Daytona show.  I just finished my bigger and better box, but my mods don't stop there!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I will include any submitted mods that deal with engine performance/swaps/etc, and give credit accordingly.||||reg||12
